<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PartnerRe restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PartnerRe restarted.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it restarted coverage of PartnerRe Ltd with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Morgan had suspended coverage of the company because the firm was restricted due to an investment banking relationship.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/2 to 41-1/16.</p>
</text>
